{"card_id": "rc17", "scene_id": "rc17_s20", "pipeline": "B2", "model": "qwen3.5-4b", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_k": 20, "min_p": 0.0, "presence_penalty": 2.0, "seed": 42, "max_tokens": 512}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "陆光，帮我看看这张照片。", "user_text_gt": "陆光，帮我看看这张照片。", "assistant_text": "哟，这大忙人什么时候有空了？（懒洋洋地推眼镜）快把照片给我瞧瞧！不过先说好，这次可不能再乱搞了……", "latency_s": 0.982, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc17_s20_1.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "啊，你不是陆光。", "user_text_gt": "啊？你不是陆光？", "assistant_text": "（猛地转头，眼睛瞪得溜圆）喂！我是程小时！刚才那是为了让你专心看重点嘛！（抓过相机晃了晃）别慌，有我在呢，先把照片拍清楚再说！", "latency_s": 1.447, "assistant_audio": "audio_cloud/rc17_s20_2.mp3", "tts_render": "qwen-audio-3.1-tts-next"}], "latency_s": 2.429}
